    "Workflow Tracking: workflowProgress linearly scans history records to track visited workflow states and determine planning readiness (sections.go:86-119).",
    "Issue - Global Mutable State: sections.go:13 declares a package-level var defaultRepoCache, which breaks thread-safety for concurrent sessions and complicates testing.",
    "Issue - O(N) History Scans: Functions like InteractionTurnCount (repo.go:107), latestContextSnapshot (repo.go:56), and workflowProgress (sections.go:93) all iterate linearly over history.Records, causing performance degradation as sessions grow.",
